{"id":"eb74a9bf6de2e2f9","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Specialization Function","display":"df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function — ZFC Tree10 Specialization Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function — ZFC Tree10 Specialization Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function — ZFC Tree10 Specialization Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c761b83cda5ce36\" href=\"?note=6c761b83cda5ce36\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function\">58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T\\in V\">\\(f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecializingFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecializingFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the canonical specializing-function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c761b83cda5ce36\" href=\"?note=6c761b83cda5ce36\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function\">58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SpecializationFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SpecializationFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the alias predicate defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}specialization\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10SpecializationFunction}_S(f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecializingFunction}_S(f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}specialization\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10SpecializationFunction}_S(f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecializingFunction}_S(f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an exact alias; the upstream predicate supplies the tree condition, the map type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:T\\to\\omega\">\\(f:T\\to\\omega\\)</span>, and separation of distinct comparable nodes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function","status":"resolved","id":"6c761b83cda5ce36","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function","status":"resolved","id":"6c761b83cda5ce36","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecializingFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the canonical specializing-function predicate (see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecializingFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10SpecializationFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}specialization\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10SpecializationFunction}_S(f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecializingFunction}_S(f,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)","display":true},{"tex":"f:T\\to\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1111,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3772","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-specialization-function]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["6c761b83cda5ce36"]}